---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /discography/index.html
title: Discography
---

<header class="section-head">
  <h1>Discography</h1>
  <p class="section-head__note">
    Sixty-one tracks, recovered from Crate 14 in original boxes and
    transferred between 1990 and 1992. Tempos throughout fall between 82 and
    84 BPM. Every track is in a major seventh. Sequence follows the order in
    which the reels were boxed, which the Archive treats as authoritative in
    the absence of anything else.
  </p>
</header>

<div class="table-wrap">
<table class="catalog">
  <caption class="caption">
    {{ collections.released | length }} released, {{ collections.tracks | length }} recovered.
  </caption>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col" class="num">No.</th>
      <th scope="col">Title</th>
      <th scope="col">Runtime</th>
      <th scope="col">Key</th>
      <th scope="col">Status</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% for track in collections.tracks %}
      <tr{% if track.data.status == "released" %} class="is-released"{% endif %}>
        <td class="num">{{ track.data.track_number }}</td>
        <td><a href="{{ track.url }}">{{ track.data.title }}</a></td>
        <td>{{ track.data.runtime if track.data.runtime else "—" }}</td>
        <td>{{ track.data.key if track.data.key else "—" }}</td>
        <td class="status">{{ track.data.status }}</td>
      </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<p class="caption">
  Runtimes are given as recorded. The runtime of &ldquo;Chardonnay
  Diplomacy&rdquo; reflects the length of the tape and not the length of the
  performance.
</p>
